    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d137">

                <pb facs="0192" n="1026" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v02/pg1026"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72112/8215</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul at Amsterdam</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Mahin</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 122</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-05-01">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 1, 1918</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The Department refers to your cablegram
                    dated April 20, 1918,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d137-f1"/> requesting information as
                    to whether the firms on the British statutory list are to be considered as
                    allies of the enemy in the event such firms do not fall within the definition of
                    the Trading with the Enemy Act, and informs you that this question has been
                    settled by the publication of the new unified list, in which list all firms on
                    the British statutory list which may properly appear upon the enemy trading list
                    of the United States have been published and those not within the statute of the
                    United States have been eliminated by the British from the statutory list.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilbur J. Carr</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
